{
  "name": "Publish a video",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "weeks",
              "triggerAtDay": [
                1
              ],
              "triggerAtHour": 9
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "schedule",
      "name": "Weekly",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "command": "cd /d \"C:\\Users\\bekircan\\OneDrive\\MASAST~1\\AI-VID~1\" && node run.mjs --niche-file niches/floor-four.md --scenes 6 --json"
      },
      "id": "render",
      "name": "Render",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeCommand",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ],
      "notes": "The node has no working-directory setting, so the cd is part of the command. The 8.3 short path is deliberate: cmd.exe cannot read the accented characters in the real path. Call node directly, not npm: npm prints its own banner to stdout and would break the JSON contract."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// The CLI returns repo-relative paths so they read the same on any machine.\n// The file nodes below resolve paths against n8n's own directory, not the\n// repo's, so this is where they become absolute.\nconst repoRoot = 'C:\\\\Users\\\\bekircan\\\\OneDrive\\\\MASAST~1\\\\AI-VID~1';\nconst absolute = (p) => repoRoot + '\\\\' + p.replace(/\\//g, '\\\\');\n\nconst raw = $json.stdout ?? '';\nlet result;\ntry {\n  result = JSON.parse(raw);\n} catch {\n  throw new Error('The render did not return JSON. stderr: ' + ($json.stderr ?? '').slice(-800));\n}\nif (!result.ok) {\n  throw new Error(result.error);\n}\n\nresult.mp4Path = absolute(result.mp4);\nif (result.cover) {\n  result.coverPath = absolute(result.cover);\n}\n\nreturn [{ json: result }];"
      },
      "id": "parse",
      "name": "Read the result",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "command": "=copy /Y \"{{ $json.mp4Path }}\" \"C:\\n8n-data\\{{ $json.slug }}.mp4\" && copy /Y \"{{ $json.coverPath }}\" \"C:\\n8n-data\\{{ $json.slug }}.jpg\""
      },
      "id": "stage",
      "name": "Copy to n8n-data",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeCommand",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        660,
        0
      ],
      "notes": "n8n's N8N_RESTRICT_FILE_ACCESS_TO limits the file nodes to C:\\n8n-data, so the render's output is staged there first. The destination names the file rather than ending in a backslash: a backslash immediately before the closing quote escapes it in cmd. Delete old files from C:\\n8n-data now and then; nothing reads them after the upload."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "filePath": "=C:\\n8n-data\\{{ $('Read the result').item.json.slug }}.mp4",
        "options": {
          "dataPropertyName": "data"
        }
      },
      "id": "readvideo",
      "name": "Read the video",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.readBinaryFile",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        880,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "video",
        "operation": "upload",
        "title": "={{ $('Read the result').item.json.title }}",
        "regionCode": "US",
        "categoryId": "24",
        "options": {
          "description": "={{ $('Read the result').item.json.description }}",
          "tags": "={{ $('Read the result').item.json.tags.join(',') }}",
          "privacyStatus": "private",
          "selfDeclaredMadeForKids": false
        }
      },
      "id": "upload",
      "name": "Upload to YouTube",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.youTube",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1100,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "filePath": "=C:\\n8n-data\\{{ $('Read the result').item.json.slug }}.jpg",
        "options": {
          "dataPropertyName": "data"
        }
      },
      "id": "readcover",
      "name": "Read the cover",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.readBinaryFile",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1320,
        0
      ],
      "notes": "A run with --no-cover returns no cover field. Disable this node and the one after it if you turn covers off."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "=https://www.googleapis.com/upload/youtube/v3/thumbnails/set?videoId={{ $('Upload to YouTube').item.json.id }}",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "youTubeOAuth2Api",
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "binaryData",
        "inputDataFieldName": "data",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "thumbnail",
      "name": "Set the cover",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1540,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "text": "=Ready: {{ $('Read the result').item.json.title }}\nhttps://youtube.com/watch?v={{ $('Upload to YouTube').item.json.id }}\n{{ $('Read the result').item.json.durationSeconds }}s, private. Review it before publishing.",
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "id": "notify",
      "name": "Tell me",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        1760,
        0
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Weekly": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Render",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Render": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Read the result",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Read the result": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Copy to n8n-data",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Copy to n8n-data": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Read the video",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Read the video": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Upload to YouTube",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Upload to YouTube": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Read the cover",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Read the cover": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Set the cover",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Set the cover": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Tell me",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  }
}
